Usage: agent-deck mcp attach <session-id> <mcp-name> [options]

Attach an MCP to a session.
Codex-compatible sessions always use the global Codex config.

Options:

Examples:
  agent-deck mcp attach my-project exa           # Attach locally (Codex uses global)
  agent-deck mcp attach my-project exa --global  # Attach globally
  agent-deck mcp attach my-project exa --restart # Attach and restart
